{"item_uid": "指考99-physics-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一重物以細繩固定於均勻木棒中心點，整個系統總重量為 mg。 甲\n甲、乙兩人站在斜坡上，從木棒兩端鉛直向上提起重物而達靜力 乙\n平衡，如圖 1 所示。甲、乙兩人的施力量值分別為 F 甲 與F 乙 ，則下\n列敘述何者正確？", "options": {"A": "F 甲 < F 乙 且 (F 甲 + F 乙 ) < mg", "B": "F 甲 < F 乙 且 (F 甲 + F 乙 ) = mg\nmg", "C": "F 甲 < F 乙 且 (F 甲 + F 乙 ) > mg", "D": "F 甲 = F 乙 且 (F 甲 + F 乙 ) = mg", "E": "F 甲 > F 乙 且 (F 甲 + F 乙 ) > mg\n圖1"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 50.0, "E": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 81.0, "E": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 40.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 22.0, "E": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 81.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 59.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 67.0, 48.0, 32.0, 17.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-physics-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "光碟表面以凹點記錄訊息，其放大側視的示意圖如圖 2 所示。\n光碟表面\n圖中讀取訊號的雷射光束中之甲與乙兩光線在經過光碟表面\n甲 乙 丙 丁\n反射之後，疊加成為建設性干涉。如果丙與丁兩光線可疊加\n成為破壞性干涉，則凹點底部的深度可為雷射光束波長的多\n少倍？\n凹點底部", "options": {"A": "2", "B": "3/2", "C": "1\n圖2", "D": "1/2", "E": "1/4"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "E", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 23.0, "E": 23.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 26.0, "E": 46.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 18.0, "E": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 33.0, "p_value": 23.0, "p_high": 46.0, "p_low": 9.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [57.0, 25.0, 15.0, 11.0, 7.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-physics-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在正常使用下，平行板電容器的電容 C 與兩極板間電位差 V 的關係為下列何者？", "options": {"A": "C與V的二次方成正比", "B": "C與V的一次方成正比", "C": "C與V無關", "D": "C與V的一次方成反比", "E": "C與V的二次方成反比"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 41.0, "E": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 57.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 25.0, "E": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 18.0, "p_value": 14.0, "p_high": 24.0, "p_low": 7.0, "discrimination": 17.0, "p_quintiles": [29.0, 14.0, 11.0, 9.0, 6.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-physics-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "近年來奈米科技發達，市場上有許多奈米商品，下列有關奈米尺度的敘述何者錯錯錯錯誤誤誤誤？", "options": {"A": "類似於使蓮花葉面不沾濕的奈米結構可用來設計表面不沾濕或不沾垢的材料。", "B": "當物質尺寸縮小到奈米大小時，可能需採用量子物理的觀點來描述該物質的特性。", "C": "當物質尺寸縮小到奈米大小時，有可能出現嶄新的化學材料或是物理特性。", "D": "同樣質量的藥粉，若藥粉顆粒的尺寸從微米尺度加工製作成為奈米尺度的顆粒，加\n工製作前後，藥粉整體的總表面積不變。", "E": "一奈米等於10-9公尺。"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 87.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 98.0, "E": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 1.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 72.0, "E": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 87.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 72.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 96.0, 92.0, 83.0, 65.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-physics-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如圖 3 所示，先將質量 M 為 1.5kg 的金屬板置於光滑水平面上，再將質量 m 為 0.5kg 的\n木塊置於金屬板上，金屬板與木塊之間的靜摩擦係數為 µ。今施一漸增的外力 F 沿水平\ns\n方向拉動木塊 m，當木塊與金屬板間開始相對滑動時，F 恰為 7.8N，則 µ值最接近下列\ns\n何者？ m F\nM", "options": {"A": "1.2", "B": "0.8", "C": "0.4", "D": "0.2", "E": "0.05 圖3\n- 1 -\n99年指考 第 2 頁\n物理考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 25.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 4.0, "E": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 42.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 7.0, "E": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 41.0, "p_value": 25.0, "p_high": 42.0, "p_low": 12.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [50.0, 29.0, 21.0, 15.0, 10.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-physics-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一車廂的天花板上有一 P 點，其正下方的地板上為 Q 點，兩點的垂直距離為 3m，該\n車廂以固定的水平速度 v往右直線前進，如圖 4 所示。在某時刻，一小球甲從 P 點\n相對於車廂自靜止自由落下，當甲球下墜至與 P 點的垂直距離為 1m 時，另一顆小\n球乙也從 P 點相對於車廂自靜止自由落下。若空氣阻力可忽略，當甲球恰落於車廂\n地板瞬間，下列敘述何者正確？\nP", "options": {"A": "甲球落於Q點，此時兩球高度差的量值大於1m\nv", "B": "甲球落於Q點，此時兩球高度差的量值等於1m", "C": "甲球落於Q點，此時兩球高度差的量值小於1m\nQ", "D": "甲球落於Q點左方，此時兩球高度差的量值大於1m\n圖4", "E": "甲球落於Q點左方，此時兩球高度差的量值等於1m\n工"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 51.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 9.0, "E": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 74.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 4.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 26.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 14.0, "E": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 74.0, "p_low": 26.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [79.0, 64.0, 55.0, 38.0, 20.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-physics-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖 5 為在水平面上的高架工作車示意圖，車體質量為 M（不含 作\n台\n支架），質心恰在前輪軸正上方，前後輪軸間距為 a。均質支 30° 支\n架質量為 M/8，支架底端的支點恰在後輪軸正上方。支架頂端 車體 架\n工作台與人員總質量為 M/4，質心恰在支架頂端正上方。設工\n作時支架與鉛垂線的夾角為 30°，要使車體不至翻覆，支架長度 a\n最大可為多少？ 圖5", "options": {"A": "8a", "B": "32a/5", "C": "16a/3", "D": "16a/5", "E": "a/8\n甲"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 17.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 6.0, "B": 61.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 15.0, "E": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 18.0, "E": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 25.0, "p_value": 33.0, "p_high": 61.0, "p_low": 10.0, "discrimination": 51.0, "p_quintiles": [68.0, 47.0, 29.0, 15.0, 7.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-physics-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一質點以 O 為圓心在一水平面上作等速率圓周運動，其速率 v\n乙\n為 v，如圖 6 所示。甲、乙、丙、丁、戊皆在圓周上，如果\n以丁點為參考點測量質點的角動量，則該質點角動量時間變 圖4 O\n丙\n化率的量值在圖 6 中哪一處最大？", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙", "C": "丙 戊\n丁", "D": "丁", "E": "戊\n圖6"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 45.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 7.0, "E": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 54.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 5.0, "E": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 35.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 9.0, "E": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 16.0, "p_value": 23.0, "p_high": 25.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 4.0, "p_quintiles": [28.0, 21.0, 23.0, 25.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-physics-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "甲行星的質量是乙行星的 25 倍，兩衛星分別以半徑為 R 甲 、 R 乙 的圓軌道繞行甲、乙\n兩行星。若 R 甲 /R 乙 =4，則兩衛星分別繞行甲、乙兩行星的週期之比值 T 甲 /T 乙 為何？", "options": {"A": "6.25", "B": "2.5", "C": "1.6", "D": "0.4", "E": "0.16\n丙乙甲"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 50.0, "D": 6.0, "E": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 84.0, "D": 4.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 8.0, "E": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 23.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 19.0, "discrimination": 65.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 71.0, 45.0, 27.0, 16.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-physics-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一個質點自水平地面朝右上方斜向拋射，在最高點\n時，突然爆裂為質量相等的甲、乙、丙三質點，如\n圖 7 所示。爆裂之後乙自靜止作自由落體運動，丙循\n原路徑回落到原拋射點。若忽略空氣阻力，則爆裂\n瞬間甲與丙速率的比值約為何？ 圖7", "options": {"A": "1/2", "B": "1", "C": "2", "D": "3", "E": "4\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 99年指考\n共 7 頁 物理考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "E", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 40.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 4.0, "E": 23.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 3.0, "E": 55.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 55.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 5.0, "E": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 15.0, "p_value": 23.0, "p_high": 55.0, "p_low": 2.0, "discrimination": 53.0, "p_quintiles": [67.0, 31.0, 11.0, 3.0, 1.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
