{"item_uid": "指考99-physics-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如圖 8 所示，一質量為 60kg 的滑雪者，由滑雪道\n頂端 P 靜止滑下，於滑道末端 R 飛出。滑道最低點 24m\nQ與 P 的垂直距離為24m， Q與 R的垂直距離為4m。\n當他於滑道末端 R 飛出時，速度的大小為 18m/s。\nR\n若過程中他保持姿勢不變，風阻亦可忽略。從 P 到\n4m\nR 因摩擦所消耗的能量與所減少的重力位能之比值\nQ\n最接近下列何者？ 圖8", "options": {"A": "1", "B": "0.8", "C": "0.3", "D": "0.2", "E": "0.1"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 38.0, "E": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 70.0, "E": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 11.0, "E": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 28.0, "p_value": 38.0, "p_high": 70.0, "p_low": 11.0, "discrimination": 59.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 54.0, 31.0, 16.0, 9.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-physics-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "飛機於長程水平飛行時，其用來平衡重力的上升力可近似為 F =αρv2， v為飛行速\n上\n率，ρ為空氣密度，α為相關的常數。若飛機此時所受的空氣阻力可假設為 F 阻 =βρv，\nβ為常數。已知空氣密度 ρ會隨著飛行高度的增加而變小。假設某一高空航線的空\n氣密度 ρ為另一低空的 1/2。僅考慮上述主要效應，並忽略浮力。若同一飛機維持固\n定的高度，水平飛行相同的航程，則在該高空與低空航線因阻力所消耗的能量之比\n為何？\n1 1 1", "options": {"A": "", "B": "", "C": "", "D": "1", "E": "2\n2 2 2 2"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 34.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 4.0, "E": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 36.0, "D": 5.0, "E": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 4.0, "E": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 33.0, "p_value": 21.0, "p_high": 36.0, "p_low": 11.0, "discrimination": 25.0, "p_quintiles": [44.0, 21.0, 14.0, 13.0, 11.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
